     155                                11$:
     156 001234 005767  015210                   tst    running                ; in running state?
     157 001240 001411                           beq    20$                    ; no - jump
     158 001242 004767  007376                   jsr    pc,pktin               ; process input packets
     159 001246 005767  015340                   tst    recvdw                 ; did we do any work receiving?
     160 001252 001404                           beq    20$                    ; no - jump
